(2629,	11,	'2011-08-22 21:44:56',	'2011-08-23 04:44:56',	'I find that the Rico Select Jazz are very consistant.I use 2m on my Blue Vandoren. I use 3s on my metal Berg Larsen  110/2 and my Guardala A 3S.\r\n\r\n-Steve Golden\r\n<a href=\"https://www.stevegolden.com/\" target=\"_blank\">SteveGolden.com</a>',	'Rico Select Jazz',	'',	'draft',	'open',	'open',	'',	'rico-select-jazz',	'',	'',	'2012-03-14 13:52:22',	'2012-03-14 20:52:22',	'',	0,	'https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local//?p=2629',	0,	'post',	'',	1,	0),
