(3085,	1,	'2011-11-01 11:42:03',	'2011-11-01 18:42:03',	'<h1><strong>SO SORRY!</strong></h1>\r\n<h2>The official sales page for Bulletproof Saxophone Playing is currently being re-built. In the meantime, please feel free to purchase the program at <a href=\"http://www.bulletproofsaxophoneplaying.com/\">http://www.bulletproofsaxophoneplaying.com/</a>.</h2>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;',	'Bulletproof Saxophone Playing',	'',	'publish',	'open',	'closed',	'',	'bulletproof-saxophone-playing',	'',	'',	'2018-06-27 13:06:34',	'2018-06-27 19:06:34',	'',	0,	'https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local//?page_id=3085',	3,	'page',	'',	0,	0),
(3099,	1,	'2011-11-07 06:00:55',	'2011-11-07 14:00:55',	'<img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-3102\" title=\"saxophone-tone\" src=\"https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local//wp-content/uploads/saxophone-tone.jpg\" alt=\"How to Sound Like the Saxophone Player you Want to Be\" width=\"628\" height=\"310\" />To change things up just a little bit, I went ahead and put this week\'s article to video.\r\n\r\nIn my little micro-movie, I cover the topic of developing your own saxophone tone in a deliberate manner so that you can sound like <em>you</em> by first deciding what \"you\" sounds like. The video is a continuation of the general theme covered in a post from a couple of weeks ago titled <a title=\"How to Stop Obsessing Over New Saxophone Gear\" href=\"https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local//how-to-stop-obsessing-over-new-saxophone-gear/\">How to Stop Obsessing Over New Saxophone Gear</a>.\r\n<h4>But <em>type is cheap</em> - check out the video and let me know what you think!</h4>\r\nhttps://youtu.be/I5eEp3eMaSQ\r\n\r\n<em><strong>Photo by <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/bnsd/\" target=\"_blank\">Bengt Nyman</a></strong></em>',	'Shopping for Your Tone: How to Sound Like the Saxophone Player you Want to Be',	'',	'publish',	'open',	'open',	'',	'shopping-for-your-tone-how-to-sound-like-the-saxophone-player-you-want-to-be',	'',	'',	'2011-11-06 21:35:41',	'2011-11-07 05:35:41',	'',	0,	'https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local//?p=3099',	0,	'post',	'',	7,	0),
