(278,	770,	'Dave Erato',	'david.erato@me.com',	'https://www.daviderato.com/blog/',	'72.135.234.73',	'2011-01-05 08:15:14',	'2011-01-05 16:15:14',	'Excellent interview!  I got in touch with Jeff via SOTW and was thinking about asking him to do an interview for my blog but you beat me to it.  Maybe I\'ll do an analysis of his insight, or get another one of those LA cats to do an interview.  Great blog too, man.',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Macintosh; U; Intel Mac OS X 10_6_5; en-US) AppleWebKit/534.10 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/8.0.552.231 Safari/534.10',	'',	0,	0),
(279,	770,	'Doron Orenstein',	'doron@bestsaxophonewebsiteever.com',	'https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local//',	'98.151.2.254',	'2011-01-05 10:11:06',	'2011-01-05 18:11:06',	'Hello Dave,\r\n\r\nThanks so much for the kind words! Jeff is a really cool guy, so hopefully he\'d be able to answer some questions for your blog as well. \r\n\r\nIt\'s always good to meet fellow sax/jazz bloggers, and I really like your site. Let\'s definitely stay in touch via Facebook and on our respective blogs. \r\n\r\nAll the best from L.A.,\r\n\r\nDoron',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Macintosh; U; Intel Mac OS X 10_6_5; en-US) AppleWebKit/534.10 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/8.0.552.231 Safari/534.10',	'',	278,	1),
(283,	164,	'Bobbie2Socks',	'rob.corrin@hotmail.co.uk',	'',	'86.29.32.54',	'2011-01-09 06:25:06',	'2011-01-09 14:25:06',	'If you want an example of one of the hottest house music saxophonists out there, go check out The Lovely Laura Fowles, who is basically the sax pin-up girl for the sophisticated Hed Kandi record label :) She\'s sensational!',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows; U; Windows NT 5.1; en-US) AppleWebKit/534.10 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/8.0.552.224 Safari/534.10',	'',	0,	0),
(284,	164,	'Doron Orenstein',	'doron@bestsaxophonewebsiteever.com',	'https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local//',	'98.151.2.254',	'2011-01-09 09:14:59',	'2011-01-09 17:14:59',	'Wow, I can\'t believe how many tour dates she has. I was also impressed by her vocal stuff. I guess house music is so big in the UK that once can make a great career exclusively out of playing sax with it. Thanks for sharing!',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Macintosh; U; Intel Mac OS X 10_6_5; en-US) AppleWebKit/534.10 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/8.0.552.231 Safari/534.10',	'',	283,	1),
(285,	164,	'Evan Tate',	'evan@evantate.com',	'http://www.evantatemusic.com',	'92.227.33.97',	'2011-01-09 14:25:10',	'2011-01-09 20:25:10',	'Another beauty is Natalie Marchenko - https://nataliemarchenko.com.',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Macintosh; U; Intel Mac OS X 10_6_5; en-US) AppleWebKit/534.10 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/8.0.552.231 Safari/534.10',	'',	0,	0),
(286,	164,	'Doron Orenstein',	'doron@bestsaxophonewebsiteever.com',	'https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local//',	'98.151.2.254',	'2011-01-09 15:45:25',	'2011-01-09 23:45:25',	'Thanks Evan! Looks like she plays in the same style as Laura Fowles. So the formula seems to be hot chick playing in a smooth jazz kind of style. \r\n\r\nPersonally, I\'d love to hear a Brecker, Kenny Garret or just a modern jazz type of approach to this kind of music, but these ladies are indeed very good at what they do. Also, I\'m sure that they make a bigger impression in the DJ booth than some goofy jazz dude (or dude-ette, for that matter) blowing Coltrane changes over a house groove in B minor (not that all jazz dudes are goofy, but you know what I mean) :)',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Macintosh; U; Intel Mac OS X 10_6_5; en-US) AppleWebKit/534.10 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/8.0.552.231 Safari/534.10',	'',	285,	1),
(296,	1098,	'allen mezquida',	'allenmez@gmail.com',	'https://www.youtube.com/user/allenmez?feature=watch',	'99.71.131.110',	'2011-01-13 17:04:31',	'2011-01-13 23:04:31',	'Your living up to the name of this website. I\'ve been geeking out here on a regular basis. Loius\' site has been a favorite for years. Great stuff Doron.',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows; U; Windows NT 5.1; en-US; rv:1.9.2.13) Gecko/20101203 Firefox/3.6.13 ( .NET CLR 3.5.30729)',	'',	0,	0),
(297,	1098,	'Doron Orenstein',	'doron@bestsaxophonewebsiteever.com',	'https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local//',	'98.151.2.254',	'2011-01-13 17:11:19',	'2011-01-14 01:11:19',	'Thanks so much Allen! I\'ve actually got it on my to do list to feature you on the site as well, so I\'ll be in touch shortly about that.',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Macintosh; U; Intel Mac OS X 10_6_5; en-US) AppleWebKit/534.10 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/8.0.552.231 Safari/534.10',	'',	296,	1),
