(576,	1974,	'Evan Tate',	'evan@evantate.com',	'http://www.evantatemusic.com',	'92.227.33.201',	'2011-06-01 03:03:28',	'2011-06-01 09:03:28',	'Good article. I hound my students about standing straight ALL THE TIME! It\'s amazing how lazy some get about it. I remind them that they\'ll have plenty of time to get bent over in old age, don\'t start now!',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Macintosh; Intel Mac OS X 10_6_7) AppleWebKit/534.24 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/11.0.696.71 Safari/534.24',	'',	0,	0),
