(160288,	1112,	'rob',	'rob.42.hills.67@googlemail.com',	'',	'109.158.102.101',	'2015-11-21 04:33:57',	'2015-11-21 12:33:57',	'Hi, having read what everyone has written, I find it very interesting and extremely helpful. Ive just come back to playing the sax after a short break (before the break I wasnt very good at playing, being self taught and totally stuck on how to progress). Quite a lot of ideas to try out so thankyou for all the ideas. I have never tried improvising on any instrument, I also havent learnt all of the scales (which I am now going to do). Hopefully things will start to click into place. Thanks again',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 6.3; WOW64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/46.0.2490.86 Safari/537.36',	'',	0,	0),
