(167888,	5386,	'Larry Weintraub',	'Lweintraub1@cox.net',	'',	'70.160.147.121',	'2015-12-27 13:10:32',	'2015-12-27 21:10:32',	'Good interview and smokin\' videos. Like Jason I also play Rico products. Orange box 2.5\'s on tenor and LaVoz hard on alto. When I did play bari I used Rico Jazz Select 3M Unfiled. Earlier on I used Rico Royal 2.5\'s on an old metal Berg Larsen 120/1 that another guy named Jimmy Lewis lent me. Jimmy was a real collector of all things musical and loved pawn shops.',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Macintosh; Intel Mac OS X 10.6; rv:43.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/43.0',	'',	0,	0),
