(213015,	4539,	'Aaron Merc',	'Scrap2y@yahoo.com',	'',	'174.213.4.39',	'2018-09-21 09:19:14',	'2018-09-21 15:19:14',	'What size brand of reed does Chad use on that 7*?',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 7.0; SM-G928V Build/NRD90M) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/69.0.3497.91 Mobile Safari/537.36',	'',	0,	0),
(213048,	4539,	'Zachary Sollitto',	'zsollitto@bellsouth.net',	'',	'107.201.109.91',	'2018-09-22 14:08:58',	'2018-09-22 20:08:58',	'Hey Aaron,\r\n\r\nI believe Chad uses a 2 or 2.5 Lupifaro Classic Cut tenor reeds.',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Macintosh; Intel Mac OS X 10_13_6) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/69.0.3497.100 Safari/537.36',	'',	213015,	0),
(213176,	6911,	'Mike',	'mtkin@btinternet.com',	'',	'213.205.241.147',	'2018-09-27 10:28:30',	'2018-09-27 16:28:30',	'Useful article Mark. \r\nI KNOW for a fact my mind wanders which is really frustrating. \r\nGonna try the bubble idea.\r\n\r\nThank you.',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (iPhone; CPU iPhone OS 11_4_1 like Mac OS X) AppleWebKit/605.1.15 (KHTML, like Gecko) Version/11.0 Mobile/15E148 Safari/604.1',	'',	0,	0),
(213188,	6911,	'Mark Morley-Fletcher',	'mark@playinthezone.com',	'https://playinthezone.com/',	'80.189.112.50',	'2018-09-27 15:09:13',	'2018-09-27 21:09:13',	'Glad you found it useful, Mike.\r\n\r\nAnd great that you\'re aware this is an issue for you. Awareness is the first thing you need before you can fix any problem.\r\n\r\nAnd although it\'s frustrating (I know that one!), don\'t get too down on yourself about it. This is totally normal - keeping focused may be conceptually simple, but it\'s really HARD. There\'s a reason why people training in meditation will spend decades improving their ability to focus...',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64; rv:62.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/62.0',	'',	213176,	0),
(213243,	2284,	'Michael',	'mtkin@btinternet.com',	'',	'85.255.232.85',	'2018-09-29 10:19:23',	'2018-09-29 16:19:23',	'Helpful article - I haven’t been able to play for a while and these are great way of getting back into practice.\r\nI’m using them for accuracy rather than speed.',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (iPad; CPU OS 11_4_1 like Mac OS X) AppleWebKit/605.1.15 (KHTML, like Gecko) Version/11.0 Mobile/15E148 Safari/604.1',	'',	0,	0),
(213316,	6911,	'J Frankie springer. Alto sax',	'Jfs75@hotmail.co.uk',	'',	'72.51.112.134',	'2018-10-03 19:41:16',	'2018-10-04 01:41:16',	'Full 8 hrs of deep sleep. 1 to 2 hr walk , with breathing exercises suffices well. Prayers and talk with God.\r\nI can take 3 hr in the bubble. Keep water to drink. Fresh air best. Or good ventilation and temperature. Room with sweet acoustics. A first class working Reed.\r\nAlone.         [alt sax, organ, trpt, bass]',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (iPad; CPU OS 11_1_1 like Mac OS X) AppleWebKit/604.3.5 (KHTML, like Gecko) Version/11.0 Mobile/15B150 Safari/604.1',	'',	0,	0),
(213389,	337,	'Stephen Fagan',	'Stephen.fagan@icloud.com',	'',	'92.238.246.117',	'2018-10-07 12:51:52',	'2018-10-07 18:51:52',	'My father had an selmer alto sax owned it from late 1950s only see markings HENR selmer Paris event France &amp; FT Range sole agent British empire Ex Canada any more info on this instrument would be fab thanx',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (iPad; CPU OS 9_3_5 like Mac OS X) AppleWebKit/601.1.46 (KHTML, like Gecko) Version/9.0 Mobile/13G36 Safari/601.1',	'',	0,	0),
(213505,	3863,	'Ross',	'Brigoli@gmail.com',	'http://www.rossbrigoli.com',	'111.65.69.11',	'2018-10-13 06:27:24',	'2018-10-13 12:27:24',	'This is the first day I received  my first saxophone and my first Reed instrument. I spent hours of finding the right embouchure. Now my lower lip is sore. I had to put some ice on it. That\'s how I got here. But I learned a lot from this article and from the comments. Very useful. I think I have a sharp lower teeth.',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 8.1.0; CLT-L29 Build/HUAWEICLT-L29) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/67.0.3396.123 Mobile Safari/537.36 EdgA/42.0.0.2549',	'',	0,	0),
(213508,	4812,	'Jay',	'adedipupodavid@gmail.com',	'',	'35.211.11.30',	'2018-10-13 08:38:03',	'2018-10-13 14:38:03',	'Very helpful in making a better saxophonist?',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 7.0; TECNO W1 Build/NRD90M) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/55.0.2883.91 Mobile Safari/537.36',	'',	0,	0),
(213594,	6929,	'Eileen Stirling',	'eileenstirling@ymail.com',	'',	'194.207.133.208',	'2018-10-17 10:12:35',	'2018-10-17 16:12:35',	'You are an inspiration Matthew, a fantastic musician and teacher! Thank you for sharing your valuable tips and for your encouraging words of wisdom. You are a brilliant saxophonist and an equally brilliant educator. You give so much to so many and always with  enduring patience, understanding and wit...... Thank you!',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (iPad; CPU OS 9_3_2 like Mac OS X) AppleWebKit/601.1.46 (KHTML, like Gecko) Version/9.0 Mobile/13F69 Safari/601.1',	'',	0,	0),
(213753,	6865,	'Larry Weintraub',	'Lweinraub1@cox.net',	'',	'68.107.158.241',	'2018-10-24 11:24:11',	'2018-10-24 17:24:11',	'I use a folding Hamilton stand for alto/tenor for years. It has holes for clarinet and flute pegs. I spent $32.00 for it. Ya know what? It works.',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Macintosh; Intel Mac OS X 10.10; rv:60.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/60.0',	'',	0,	0),
(213755,	6833,	'Gene',	'gfesta2461@gmail.com',	'',	'96.242.154.105',	'2018-10-24 13:14:38',	'2018-10-24 19:14:38',	'Mark\r\nI feel like you wrote this article for me.  I think i have learned more from my Thursday night jams than I have from the hours of practice. And every time I get up in from of an audience, out of my comfort zone, I gain a little more confidence.\r\nCheers',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/70.0.3538.67 Safari/537.36',	'',	0,	0),
