(224432,	7235,	'Tony Forino',	't.forino@yahoo.com',	'',	'86.21.167.31',	'2019-11-28 16:15:17',	'2019-11-28 22:15:17',	'Could try half step up to C# coming down then D going up. Or common changes such as 4ths. ? Then on pentatonic naturals in 3rds',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 10; Pixel 3a XL) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/78.0.3904.108 Mobile Safari/537.36',	'',	0,	0),
(224507,	6525,	'Tom Delaney',	'tomdly@sbcglobal.net',	'',	'69.109.4.23',	'2019-11-30 14:06:04',	'2019-11-30 20:06:04',	'To improve your playing - just play the instrument a lot! Pick it up and play every day. I\'m not going to say it HAS to be a certain amount of time each day - like an hour a day....NO.....just play it every day as you like. As time moves on, you\'ll get better and better. When you start getting pretty good....then you\'ll want to play it a lot. JOB DONE. People like to do a lot of what they\'re good at!  YOU WILL TOO.',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64; rv:70.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/70.0',	'',	0,	0),
(224535,	3694,	'KT BluesCat',	'ktbluescat@hotmail.com',	'',	'97.120.187.68',	'2019-12-01 07:10:32',	'2019-12-01 13:10:32',	'I liked the cake, but I would love to play the big horn. Makes my Bari look like a toy.',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 7.1.1; K88 Build/NMF26V; wv) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Version/4.0 Chrome/78.0.3904.108 Safari/537.36 [FB_IAB/FB4A;FBAV/248.1.0.44.116;]',	'',	0,	0),
(224552,	3827,	'Richard Smith',	'rblooz@juno.com',	'http://n/a',	'98.248.28.243',	'2019-12-01 17:05:12',	'2019-12-01 23:05:12',	'Rayburn Music in Boston - Emilio Lyons , sax repair wizard. It\'s been over 20 years since I had my Balanced Action Tenor overhauled by Emilio. I\'ve since had it overhauled by a hack in San Francisco. The difference is night and day. Emilio, if he\'s still around is the best sax repairman in the land. Rayburn Music left a  lot to be desired in terms of ambience and sales appeal but I can\'t say enough good things about Emilio Lyons.',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Macintosh; Intel Mac OS X 10.11; rv:70.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/70.0',	'',	0,	0),
(224840,	6945,	'Mark',	'mark.colby@sbcglobal.net',	'http://mark%20colby.com',	'98.223.27.68',	'2019-12-07 23:35:42',	'2019-12-08 05:35:42',	'Have you compared them to the new vintage rubber Links! I think that they play the closest to the original slant models',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (iPhone; CPU iPhone OS 13_1_3 like Mac OS X) AppleWebKit/605.1.15 (KHTML, like Gecko) Mobile/15E148 [FBAN/FBIOS;FBDV/iPhone9,1;FBMD/iPhone;FBSN/iOS;FBSV/13.1.3;FBSS/2;FBID/phone;FBLC/en_US;FBOP/5;FBCR/Verizon]',	'',	0,	0),
(224940,	7369,	'Anthony Flood',	'anthonybflood@yahoo.com',	'',	'73.146.228.13',	'2019-12-09 17:53:02',	'2019-12-09 23:53:02',	'Brilliant advice...especially regarding TONE...the most important element of your sound, IMHO Use whatever works (sounds) best with you playing. Danny is a MASTER SAXOPHONIST/COMPOSER, as anyone familiar with Marbin knows. GREAT ADVICE, DANNY!!',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; WOW64; Trident/7.0; Touch; rv:11.0) like Gecko',	'',	0,	0),
(225070,	6945,	'William Scavotto',	'wsca47@gmail.com',	'',	'68.9.192.46',	'2019-12-12 17:48:10',	'2019-12-12 23:48:10',	'I was going to get a new Otto Link but there was so much negative response in regard to the quality I decided not to get it',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (iPad; CPU OS 12_4_3 like Mac OS X) AppleWebKit/605.1.15 (KHTML, like Gecko) Version/12.1.2 Mobile/15E148 Safari/604.1',	'',	0,	0),
(225077,	6945,	'Zachary Sollitto',	'zsollitto@bellsouth.net',	'',	'99.155.39.225',	'2019-12-12 19:15:31',	'2019-12-13 01:15:31',	'Hey William,\r\n\r\nI agree that the new modern links are a hit or miss in terms of overall quality but if your interested in a hard rubber or metal link, I\'d recommend going to your local music store and see if they have a few for you to try. If a 6 or 7 tip opening is your preference, see if they have 2,3,4 or 5 was 7 tip opening links so you can see how they each compare. I have also play a few modern re-faced links that have been quite good.\r\n\r\nBest,\r\n\r\nZach',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Macintosh; Intel Mac OS X 10_14_6) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/78.0.3904.108 Safari/537.36',	'',	225070,	0),
