(225110,	4854,	'Zachary Sollitto',	'zsollitto@bellsouth.net',	'',	'192.161.159.18',	'2019-12-13 15:11:15',	'2019-12-13 21:11:15',	'Hey David,\r\n\r\nGood point. I will be working on another updated article in the near future since there have been some new re-facers that have entered the market. I did not include Jody at the time because I was focused mainly on just re-facers and not the combination of mouthpieces and refacers at that time. The good news is we have so many options to choose from today compared to years past.',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Macintosh; Intel Mac OS X 10_14_6) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/78.0.3904.108 Safari/537.36',	'',	225106,	0),
