(225492,	3863,	'Ray Hutcherson',	'raycorri@yahoo.com',	'',	'64.138.193.164',	'2019-12-26 10:07:03',	'2019-12-26 16:07:03',	'Hey Doron,\r\nYeah, it\'s me. Bay LipEase has worked great and has helped my youngest son start working on overtones and altissimo production. Others may find it helpful to start out a practice session utilizing a \"double lipped\" embouchure which may pinpoint if they have been playing excessively tight. Just my 2 cents. Good to see life is treating you well.',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 6.1; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/79.0.3945.88 Safari/537.36',	'',	0,	0),
