(225633,	7373,	'Grant Koeller',	'gkoeller@woh.rr.com',	'',	'104.231.8.157',	'2020-01-01 04:57:33',	'2020-01-01 10:57:33',	'I love the Gap Cap!! When I received the Gap Cap, I could tell this was a quality sax accessory. I was really impressed how it could be easily adjusted to fit my Walt Johnson tenor case with my  1952 Selmer Super Balanced Action.  The Gap Cap adjustment screw had wonderful precision threads and  was great  to adjust for the perfect custom fit!!! No more loose sax in case !!! The Gap Cap  lets the air breath too!!! No more stopped up end plug with mold!   I love it!!!!',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (X11; CrOS x86_64 12607.58.0) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/79.0.3945.86 Safari/537.36',	'',	0,	0),
