(228400,	7137,	'John Guarnera',	'Deuterium1981@Yahoo.com',	'',	'71.127.8.203',	'2020-04-19 01:02:39',	'2020-04-19 06:02:39',	'Nice.......Really nice.\r\nSince it is 11:45pm I can\'t play it until my normal starting time at 6am. I could only Sight-Sing it in my mind and it sounded really good swinging at around 220 which is a good slow Bebop tempo.\r\nIt also seemed like it would be a good Sax Soli. I had a really good Sax Section from 8th grade in High School through college. We were so tight we did Soli\'s from memory and could handle Supersax arr like Yard\'s \"Kim #1\" !',	0,	'1',	'Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 9; KFMAWI) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Silk/80.5.3 like Chrome/80.0.3987.162 Safari/537.36',	'',	0,	0),
