(229417,	7809,	'Leon Zunec',	'leo_zingy@hotmail.com',	'',	'89.142.191.214',	'2016-04-22 11:43:52',	'2016-04-22 18:43:52',	'Will this fit a Yanagisawa A-WO1, which has a completely different position of the lyre holder (lower down, at the side)? How long is the Klangbogen bar - in cm or inches please, \"it\'s quite long\" doesn\'t help :) :) :)  Any info would be greatly appreciated!',	0,	'1',	'',	'',	0,	0),
