(87,	'widget_text',	'a:24:{i:4;a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:27:\"Make Money & Get Free Press\";s:4:\"text\";s:458:\"If you\'re a <strong>devoted sax player, saxophone web site owner, music educator, music journalist, rabid fan of the saxophone, or all of the above</strong>, we’d love to have you contribute to the site. \n\nBesides the fame and power that come with contributing to (what we consider) the Best Saxophone Website Ever, you can score some cash while you\'re at it! \n\n<strong><a href=\"/contribute\" class=\"link_underline\">Click here for full details.</a></strong>\";s:6:\"filter\";b:1;s:12:\"widget_logic\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:7:\"Sam Ash\";s:4:\"text\";s:426:\"<div class=\"300px_ad\"><a target=\'new\' href=\"https://click.linksynergy.com/fs-bin/click?id=HRLLNJha7rU&offerid=163557.10000051&type=4&subid=0\"><IMG alt=\"Free ground shipping on EVERYTHING!\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://www.samash.com/opencms/opencms/samash/library/images/sad_300x250.jpg\"></a><IMG border=\"0\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" src=\"https://ad.linksynergy.com/fs-bin/show?id=HRLLNJha7rU&bids=163557.10000051&type=4&subid=0\"></div>\";s:6:\"filter\";b:0;s:12:\"widget_logic\";s:0:\"\";}i:6;a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:23:\"The Latest from Twitter\";s:4:\"text\";s:608:\"<script src=\"https://widgets.twimg.com/j/2/widget.js\"></script>\r\n<script>\r\nnew TWTR.Widget({\r\n  version: 2,\r\n  type: \'profile\',\r\n  rpp: 2,\r\n  interval: 6000,\r\n  width: \'auto\',\r\n  height: \'170\',\r\n  theme: {\r\n    shell: {\r\n      background: \'#9ccfee\',\r\n      color: \'#000\'\r\n    },\r\n    tweets: {\r\n      background: \'#000000\',\r\n      color: \'#ffffff\',\r\n      links: \'#9ccfee\'\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  features: {\r\n    scrollbar: false,\r\n    loop: false,\r\n    live: true,\r\n    hashtags: true,\r\n    timestamp: true,\r\n    avatars: false,\r\n    behavior: \'all\'\r\n  }\r\n}).render().setUser(\'bestsaxophonewe\').start();\r\n</script>\";s:6:\"filter\";b:0;s:12:\"widget_logic\";s:0:\"\";}i:7;a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:22:\"Check out the Podcast \";s:4:\"text\";s:311:\"<a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/podcast/best-saxophone-podcast-ever/id401548571\" target=\"_blank\"><img align=\"left\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/podcast.jpg\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Podcast\" /></a>Hop on over to iTunes for interviews with some of the greatest sax players and educators out there!\";s:6:\"filter\";b:0;s:12:\"widget_logic\";s:0:\"\";}i:8;a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:15:\"Got a Question?\";s:4:\"text\";s:308:\"If there\'s anything saxophone-related you\'re itching to know, please ask it <a href=\"/contact\" class=\"text_underline\">here</a> and we\'ll do our best to answer your question either on the blog, or directly via email. \n\n<strong><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"text_underline\">So reach out, don\'t be shy!</a></strong>\";s:6:\"filter\";b:1;s:12:\"widget_logic\";s:0:\"\";}i:9;a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:28:\"The Latest in Saxophone News\";s:4:\"text\";s:201:\"<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"/tag/week-in-saxophone/\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/week_in_saxophone_270.jpg\" width=\"270\" height=\"113\" alt=\"The Week in Saxophone\" border=\"0\" /></a>\n</div>\";s:6:\"filter\";b:0;s:12:\"widget_logic\";s:0:\"\";}i:10;a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:8:\"Welcome!\";s:4:\"text\";s:481:\"<a href=\"/about\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/doron2-120x120.jpg\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" alt=\"Welcome to the Best. Saxophone. Website. Ever.\" style=\"float:left; border:1px solid #000; margin:0 10px 10px 0\" /></a>Greetings! My name is Doron Orenstein and I\'ll be your friendly tour guide here at Best. Saxophone. Website. Ever. \r\n<br clear=\"all\" /><strong><a href=\"/about\" class=\"sidebar_link\">Click here to learn more about the purpose of our little website</a>. &#187;</strong>\";s:6:\"filter\";b:1;s:12:\"widget_logic\";s:0:\"\";}i:11;a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:25:\"Ask a Saxophone Repairman\";s:4:\"text\";s:478:\"<a href=\"/ask-a-saxophone-repairman\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/matt-stohrer_120x120.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Ask a Saxophone Repairman\" style=\"float:right; border:1px solid #000; margin:0 0 5px 10px\"></a>Got questions about buying or repairing a horn, mouthpieces, ligatures or any other sax-related products? Repair and sales guru <strong>Matt Stohrer</strong> will tell you all you need to know.   \r\n\r\n<strong><a href=\"/ask-a-saxophone-repairman\">More info</a> &#187;</strong>\";s:6:\"filter\";b:1;s:12:\"widget_logic\";s:0:\"\";}i:13;a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"text\";s:71:\"<div class=\"ad\">\r\n[tthq_include_file tthq_file=\"ad-468x60.php\"]\r\n</div>\";s:6:\"filter\";b:0;s:12:\"widget_logic\";s:0:\"\";}i:15;a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"text\";s:330:\"<div class=\"300px_ad\">\r\n<a href=\"https://macsax.com/macsax-hard-rubber-saxophone-mouthpieces/\"  target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local//wp-content/uploads/bob-sheppard-signature-300x250-blue.jpg\" width=\"300\" height=\"250\" alt=\"MACSAX Bob Sheppard Signature Series Mouthpieces\" border=\"0\" /></a>\r\n</div>\";s:6:\"filter\";b:0;s:12:\"widget_logic\";s:0:\"\";}i:19;a:5:{s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"text\";s:49:\"[tthq_include_file tthq_file=\"ad-120x600-01.php\"]\";s:6:\"filter\";b:1;s:12:\"widget_logic\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"visual\";b:1;}i:21;a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"text\";s:49:\"[tthq_include_file tthq_file=\"ad-300x250-02.php\"]\";s:6:\"filter\";b:0;s:12:\"widget_logic\";s:0:\"\";}i:22;a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"text\";s:49:\"[tthq_include_file tthq_file=\"ad-300x250-04.php\"]\";s:6:\"filter\";b:0;s:12:\"widget_logic\";s:0:\"\";}i:23;a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"text\";s:49:\"[tthq_include_file tthq_file=\"ad-300x250-05.php\"]\";s:6:\"filter\";b:0;s:12:\"widget_logic\";s:0:\"\";}i:24;a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"text\";s:49:\"[tthq_include_file tthq_file=\"ad-300x250-03.php\"]\";s:6:\"filter\";b:0;s:12:\"widget_logic\";s:0:\"\";}i:25;a:4:{s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:4: