(888,	1,	'2010-12-07 08:00:28',	'2010-12-07 16:00:28',	'<img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-889\" title=\"photos\" src=\"https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local//wp-content/uploads/photos.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"628\" height=\"293\" />\r\n\r\nSure, we all <em>say</em> that we could care less about reading on Twitter what someone had for lunch, or looking at pictures of our boss\' birthday party on Facebook, but you know what?\r\n\r\n<strong><em>We\'re lying.</em></strong>\r\n\r\nWhether we admit it or not, <strong>we all have a voyeuristic side</strong>, yours truly most certainly included. And it\'s not a bad thing, it\'s just human nature.\r\n\r\nSince I\'m always thinking of ways to make my site more compelling, I figured that I\'d add <strong>a section that I, myself would totally be checking out on <em>anyone else\'s</em> site</strong>. That section being - you guessed it - the photos. <strong>It\'s not that I think that I\'m so interesting</strong>, but it\'s really because I\'d really love to get to know all of you better.\r\n\r\nAlready, <strong>I feel like I\'m making friends with a good number of the readers</strong> in the comments section and direct emails sent through the site, as well as via forums on other sites, Facebook, and Twitter. So why not share bits and pieces of my life with my new friends? The photos will be coming directly from the Best. Saxophone. Website. Ever. Facebook page, so if you haven\'t connected with me there, <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/bestsaxophonewebsiteever\" target=\"_blank\">then please go ahead and do so</a>.\r\n\r\nSo without further ado, I present to you...\r\n<h4><strong>The Best. Saxophone. Website. Ever. Photos Page!</strong></h4>\r\n<a href=\"https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local//photos\"><strong>https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local//photos</strong></a>\r\n\r\n<em>(also accessible by clicking the \"Photos\" link at the upper-right-hand side of the site)</em>\r\n\r\n<strong>Take a look, let me know what you think, and enjoy!</strong>',	'New Photos Page',	'',	'draft',	'open',	'open',	'',	'new-photos-page',	'',	'https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local//photos\nhttps://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local//photos',	'2012-02-20 10:55:32',	'2012-02-20 18:55:32',	'',	0,	'https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local//?p=888',	0,	'post',	'',	0,	0),
