(1278,	1,	'2011-01-09 20:27:54',	'2011-01-10 04:27:54',	'Vandoren Java Reeds (green) are an industry standard beloved by many professional saxophone players in the jazz and contemporary music world. And the popularity of these reeds is no coincidence. Of course, Vandoren doesn\'t make the cheapest reeds, but in the end you get what you pay for.\r\n\r\nMy experience with these reeds has been excellent as these are the reeds that I\'ve played on for many, many years. I find the tonal quality I get with these reeds is rich, smooth, bright, but not overly bright and thin. The reeds respond superbly, never feeling waterlogged or weak, especially if I\'m playing on a reed whose strength is a bit on the stiff side for me.\r\n\r\nCompared to the other reeds I\'ve tried, Vandoren Java Reeds are among the very best I\'ve played.\r\n\r\n<strong>Audio Sample of LaVoz saxophone reed:</strong>\r\n[audio: Vandoren_Java_FINAL.mp3]\r\n\r\n<strong>My Setup During the Review:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Selmer Mark VI tenor saxophone, Serial # 132443</li>\r\n	<li>New York Otto Link mouthpiece</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n« <strong><a href=\"/saxophone-reed-reviews/\">Return to the Saxophone Reed Comparison Chart</a></strong>',	'Vandoren Java Saxophone Reeds',	'',	'draft',	'open',	'open',	'',	'vandoren-java-saxophone-reeds',	'',	'',	'2012-03-14 13:52:27',	'2012-03-14 20:52:27',	'',	0,	'https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local//?p=1278',	0,	'post',	'',	4,	0),
(1280,	1,	'2011-01-09 20:30:38',	'2011-01-10 04:30:38',	'<h3>Below is a ranking of reeds based on the following three criteria:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Sound Quality:</strong> <em>How rich and refined is your tone when playing these reeds?</em></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Consistency:</strong> <em>Out of a group of reeds, were most of them of similar quality?</em></li>\r\n	<li><strong>Response: </strong><em>How did these reeds feel when playing? Did articulation on these reeds seem unfocused? Did the sound become constricted when playing loudly - even when you were using the correct strength?</em></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Would you like to review a brand of reed not listed here? <a href=\"/saxophone-product-reviews/saxophone-reed-reviews/reed-review-submission/\">Click here to submit your review!</a></h3>\r\n<strong>Otherwise, you can add your review to any of the reeds listed below by clicking the \"Read Full Review\" buttons below.</strong>\r\n<div class=\"top_reviewer_promo\" id=\"reed_reviewer\">\r\n<h2>Top Reviewer:</h2>\r\n<h3>\"Jason the Obscure\"</h3>\r\n<em>Review some of the reeds below, or add your own reed reivews and this could be YOU!</em>\r\n</div>\r\n[myrpcomparison category_id=\"43\"]\r\n<strong>&laquo; <a href=\"../\">BACK TO SAXOPHONE PRODUCT REVIEWS PAGE</a></strong>',	'Saxophone Reed Reviews',	'',	'draft',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'saxophone-reed-reviews',	'',	'',	'2012-03-14 13:54:11',	'2012-03-14 20:54:11',	'',	1448,	'https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local//',	2,	'page',	'',	0,	0),
(1299,	1,	'2011-01-16 15:20:16',	'2011-01-16 23:20:16',	'A favorite among sax players such as Michael Brecker, David Sanborn, and Stanley Turrentine to name just a few, LaVoz saxophone reeds are some of the most popular reeds in the world. These are actually the reeds that I started out playing on back as in middle school.\r\n\r\nMany years after having played my last LaVox reed, I was quite impressed by my former brand. The sound was quite bright - which works for my taste, but if you\'re going for a darker sound this may not be the reed for you. None of the 3 reeds I tried out we too terrible, and the responsiveness was pretty nice as well, although I think that these reeds run a bit softer than other brands such as the Vandoren Javas.\r\n\r\nAll in all, LaVoz reeds are among the best reeds on the market.\r\n\r\n<strong>Audio Sample of LaVoz saxophone reed:</strong>\r\n[audio: LaVoz_FINAL.mp3]\r\n\r\n<strong>My Setup During the Review:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Selmer Mark VI tenor saxophone, Serial # 132443</li>\r\n	<li>New York Otto Link mouthpiece</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n« <strong><a href=\"/saxophone-reed-reviews/\">Return to the Saxophone Reed Comparison Chart</a></strong>',	'LaVoz Saxophone Reeds',	'',	'draft',	'open',	'open',	'',	'lavoz-saxophone-reeds',	'',	'',	'2012-03-14 13:52:27',	'2012-03-14 20:52:27',	'',	0,	'https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local//?p=1299',	0,	'post',	'',	4,	0),
