(1763,	1,	'2011-03-01 07:00:09',	'2011-03-01 15:00:09',	'<img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-1778\" title=\"Bob-Sheppard\" src=\"https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local//wp-content/uploads/Bob-Sheppard.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"628\" height=\"229\" />\r\n\r\nA household name for saxophonists worldwide, Bob Sheppard has done it all. Superstar names such as <strong>Chick Corea, Herbie Hancock, Perter Erskine, Joni Mitchell, Steely Dan, Stevie Wonder</strong> and many, many, many legends pack his world-class resume. Splitting his time between Los Angeles, and New York, Bob\'s forged working relationships with the best musicians on both coasts.\r\n\r\nAs a first-call multi-woodwind studio sideman, he\'s played on <strong>over a hundred movie and television soundtracks</strong>, and can occasionally be heard soloing on the massively popular television show, <strong>American Idol.</strong>\r\n\r\nWith his new album, <strong><em>Close Your Eyes</em></strong>, Bob recruits <strong>Antonio Sanchez, Gabe Noel, John Beasley, and Alan Pasqua</strong> along with other greats to create a sonically rich interactive jazz experience.\r\n\r\nAs a passionate music educator, Sheppard is a part-time faculty member at the <strong>USC Thorton School of Music</strong>, and frequently a guest clinician at colleges around the country.\r\n<h4><strong>Listen right here:</strong></h4>\r\n[embed]https://bestsaxophonewebsiteever.com/podcasts/bob_sheppard_interview.mp3[/embed]\r\n<h3><a href=\"https://bestsaxophonewebsiteever.com/podcasts/bob_sheppard_interview.mp3\"><strong>Download the Podcast MP3</strong></a></h3>\r\n<h3><a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/podcast/best-saxophone-podcast-ever/id401548571\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>Hop on Over to Our iTunes Podcast Page</strong></a></h3>\r\n<h4>Learn more about Jon at <a href=\"https://www.bobsheppard.net/\">www.bobsheppard.net</a></h4>\r\n<h4>Bob doing his thing with Herbie Hancock:</h4>\r\nhttps://youtu.be/X5x18tQeTdQ',	'Bob Sheppard Talks Recording, Practicing, Chick Corea, and More',	'',	'publish',	'open',	'open',	'',	'bob-sheppard-talks-recording-practicing-chick-corea-and-more',	'',	'',	'2020-06-27 07:42:51',	'2020-06-27 12:42:51',	'',	0,	'https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local//?p=1763',	0,	'post',	'',	8,	0),
