(1902,	1,	'2011-03-22 21:55:40',	'0000-00-00 00:00:00',	'<div>PRESS KIT PDF ATTACHED TO THIS ARTICLE</div>\n<ol>\n	<li>What was it that inspired you to make music your life?</li>\n	<li>What\'s the single best piece of advice you\'ve been given over the course of your playing career?</li>\n	<li>What do you find yourself practicing the most these days?</li>\n	<li>What non-jazz music have you been listening to lately?</li>\n	<li>What\'s the next musical frontier for JD Allen?</li>\n	<li>What would you say to someone looking to make a life for themselves as a professional saxophonist?</li>\n	<li>For those new to your music, which recording would you suggest they pick up?</li>\n	<li>What\'s your saxophone equipment setup?</li>\n</ol>',	'JD Allen Interview',	'',	'draft',	'open',	'open',	'',	'',	'',	'',	'2011-03-22 21:55:40',	'2011-03-23 04:55:40',	'',	0,	'https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local//?p=1902',	0,	'post',	'',	0,	0),
