(4750,	1,	'2013-11-17 15:17:11',	'2013-11-17 23:17:11',	'<img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4751\" alt=\"Jazz Lessons with Giants for Amazon Kindle\" src=\"https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local//wp-content/uploads/jlwg_kindle.jpg\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" />Hey guys,\r\n\r\nI just wanted to take a moment to let you know that<strong> the e-book portion of<em> Jazz Lessons with Giants</em> is now available specifically for Amazon Kindle</strong>. While you can indeed transfer the e-book into your Kindle, this Kindle-specific version is <strong>formatted specifically for that device</strong>, so it will be a bit easier to read and navigate this way.\r\n\r\nYou can find the Kindle version by searching the Amazon book store on your Kindle, or by going to the URL below and having the book transferred onto your Kindle.\r\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Jazz-Lessons-Giants-Bob-Mintzer-ebook/dp/B00GIUW4VY\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.amazon.com/Jazz-Lessons-Giants-Bob-Mintzer-ebook/dp/B00GIUW4VY</a>\r\n\r\nSo that\'s it, please <a title=\"Contact\" href=\"https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local//contact/\">let me know</a> if you have any questions.\r\n\r\nThanks!\r\n\r\nDoron',	'Jazz Lessons with Giants Now Available for Amazon Kindle ',	'',	'publish',	'open',	'open',	'',	'jazz-lessons-with-giants-now-available-for-amazon-kindle',	'',	'',	'2013-11-17 15:18:59',	'2013-11-17 23:18:59',	'',	0,	'https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local//?p=4750',	0,	'post',	'',	0,	0),
