(6348,	1,	'2018-01-16 21:44:16',	'2018-01-17 03:44:16',	'In keeping with the spirit of honoring the recent anniversary of the passing of the great Michael Brecker, saxman Larry Weintraub shares a fascinating and informative in-depth account of an all-day workshop Michael gave at the Atlantic Fleet Band (a military band for those of you unfamiliar with it) back in 2003. In addition to some great anecdotes that speak to Brecker\'s sincere and generous spirit, there are also some great practical tips that you can start applying right away. Having a hard time thinking of a better source of musical wisdom than Brecker himself!  ',	'In keeping with the spirit of honoring the recent anniversary of the passing of the great Michael Brecker, saxman Larry Weintraub shares a fascinating and informative in-depth account of an ...',	'',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'in-keeping-with-the-spirit-of-honoring-the-recent-anniversary-of-the-passing-of-the-great-michael-brecker-saxman-larry-weintraub-shares-a-fascinating-and-informative-in-depth-account-of-an',	'',	'',	'2018-01-16 21:44:16',	'2018-01-17 03:44:16',	'',	0,	'https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local/nxs_qp/in-keeping-with-the-spirit-of-honoring-the-recent-anniversary-of-the-passing-of-the-great-michael-brecker-saxman-larry-weintraub-shares-a-fascinating-and-informative-in-depth-account-of-an/',	0,	'nxs_qp',	'',	0,	0),
