(6421,	1,	'2018-02-20 22:00:07',	'2018-02-21 04:00:07',	'If you\'ve ever picked up a saxophone (and chances are, you have if you\'re reading this post), then you would have to be living under a rock to not know who living legend, Bob Mintzer is. I\'m very honored to have Bob contribute an article with the site, and this has instantly become one of my all-time favorites on BSWE. As sax players it\'s easy to fall into the trap of having \"tunnel-vision\" focus on single-note melodic content. However, what separates a good musician from a truly *great* musician is the ability to work with *all* of the dimensions of music, since when you do that, you become a musician whose playing carries true depth and weight. Lucky for us, Bob lays out a path for getting there.  ',	'If you\'ve ever picked up a saxophone (and chances are, you have if you\'re reading this post), then you would have to be living under a rock to not know who living legend, Bob Mintzer is. I\'m very ...',	'',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'if-youve-ever-picked-up-a-saxophone-and-chances-are-you-have-if-youre-reading-this-post-then-you-would-have-to-be-living-under-a-rock-to-not-know-who-living-legend-bob-mintzer-is-im-very',	'',	'',	'2018-02-20 22:28:16',	'2018-02-21 04:28:16',	'',	0,	'https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local/nxs_qp/if-youve-ever-picked-up-a-saxophone-and-chances-are-you-have-if-youre-reading-this-post-then-you-would-have-to-be-living-under-a-rock-to-not-know-who-living-legend-bob-mintzer-is-im-very/',	0,	'nxs_qp',	'',	0,	0),
