(6628,	1,	'2018-05-11 11:57:25',	'2018-05-11 17:57:25',	'Some of you remember, a few months back I asked for questions for sax legend, David Liebman, which would be asked during a Q & A session. Well, at long-last, the audio of our discussion is live on the site. It\'s always exciting getting to chat with Liebman. since when he speaks, you know it\'s the \"gospel truth\" of jazz, as he\'s played such a significant part in the history of this music. We dive into some really cool topics around odd meters, improvisation and the creative process, plus a bunch more. You can listen on the site, download it onto any device, or add the podcast episode using iTunes or however you get your podcasts. Enjoy!',	'Some of you remember, a few months back I asked for questions for sax legend, David Liebman, which would be asked during a Q & A session. Well, at long-last, the audio of our discussion is live ...',	'',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'some-of-you-remember-a-few-months-back-i-asked-for-questions-for-sax-legend-david-liebman-which-would-be-asked-during-a-q-a-session-well-at-long-last-the-audio-of-our-discussion-is-live',	'',	'',	'2018-05-11 11:57:25',	'2018-05-11 17:57:25',	'',	0,	'https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local/nxs_qp/some-of-you-remember-a-few-months-back-i-asked-for-questions-for-sax-legend-david-liebman-which-would-be-asked-during-a-q-a-session-well-at-long-last-the-audio-of-our-discussion-is-live/',	0,	'nxs_qp',	'',	0,	0),
