(6671,	1,	'2018-05-30 05:31:47',	'2018-05-30 11:31:47',	'(Sheet music included) Although it\'s easier said then done, there really is never any reason to run out of things to play. The only limitation is our own musical imagination. In this article, NYC jazz saxophone pro and educator, Sam Sadigursky shows us how we can expand that musical imagination using different rhythmic patterns, while at the same time giving our fingers and articulation skills a workout. ',	'(Sheet music included) Although it\'s easier said then done, there really is never any reason to run out of things to play. The only limitation is our own musical imagination. In this article, NYC ...',	'',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'sheet-music-included-although-its-easier-said-then-done-there-really-is-never-any-reason-to-run-out-of-things-to-play-the-only-limitation-is-our-own-musical-imagination-in-this-article-nyc',	'',	'',	'2018-05-30 11:48:03',	'2018-05-30 17:48:03',	'',	0,	'https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local/nxs_qp/sheet-music-included-although-its-easier-said-then-done-there-really-is-never-any-reason-to-run-out-of-things-to-play-the-only-limitation-is-our-own-musical-imagination-in-this-article-nyc/',	0,	'nxs_qp',	'',	0,	0),
