(6716,	1,	'2018-06-17 07:25:58',	'2018-06-17 13:25:58',	'Many of us first got know Rick Margitza from his early days playing with Miles as well as his recordings with Blue Note. Of course, he has gone on to record extensively as a solo artist and sideman, and tour the world for decades now, cementing his position as one of the jazz world\'s most creative and distinctive improvisors. In this article, he shares a powerful melodic approach as applied to the jazz standard, \"Cherokee\", complete with sheet music showing 3 separate approaches to the technique.   ',	'Many of us first got know Rick Margitza from his early days playing with Miles as well as his recordings with Blue Note. Of course, he has gone on to record extensively as a solo artist and ...',	'',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'many-of-us-first-got-know-rick-margitza-from-his-early-days-playing-with-miles-as-well-as-his-recordings-with-blue-note-of-course-he-has-gone-on-to-record-extensively-as-a-solo-artist-and',	'',	'',	'2018-06-17 07:25:58',	'2018-06-17 13:25:58',	'',	0,	'https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local/nxs_qp/many-of-us-first-got-know-rick-margitza-from-his-early-days-playing-with-miles-as-well-as-his-recordings-with-blue-note-of-course-he-has-gone-on-to-record-extensively-as-a-solo-artist-and/',	0,	'nxs_qp',	'',	0,	0),
