(6893,	1,	'2018-08-29 05:27:38',	'2018-08-29 11:27:38',	'For me, carrying around a sax stand has always meant I needed to lug an extra bag with me whenever taking my horn anywhere. But Gijs van Leeuwen of WoodWindDesign has provided us with a solution designed to be both extremely portable  and extremely sturdy. BSWE resident gear maven Zach Sollitto takes the stand for a spin and gives us the lowdown on whether or not it stands lives up to the Gijs\' vision.  ',	'For me, carrying around a sax stand has always meant I needed to lug an extra bag with me whenever taking my horn anywhere. But Gijs van Leeuwen of WoodWindDesign has provided us with a solution ...',	'',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'for-me-carrying-around-a-sax-stand-has-always-meant-i-needed-to-lug-an-extra-bag-with-me-whenever-taking-my-horn-anywhere-but-gijs-van-leeuwen-of-woodwinddesign-has-provided-us-with-a-solution',	'',	'',	'2018-08-29 05:27:38',	'2018-08-29 11:27:38',	'',	0,	'https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local/nxs_qp/for-me-carrying-around-a-sax-stand-has-always-meant-i-needed-to-lug-an-extra-bag-with-me-whenever-taking-my-horn-anywhere-but-gijs-van-leeuwen-of-woodwinddesign-has-provided-us-with-a-solution/',	0,	'nxs_qp',	'',	0,	0),
