(6916,	1,	'2018-09-19 11:40:59',	'2018-09-19 17:40:59',	'You can shed all you want, but if you\'re not focused on the task at hand while in the practice room, then progress will be slow and painful. Mar Morley-Fletcher shows us how to avoid this trap in a way that has the added bonus of improving your live performances as well. ',	'You can shed all you want, but if you\'re not focused on the task at hand while in the practice room, then progress will be slow and painful. Mar Morley-Fletcher shows us how to avoid this trap in ...',	'',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'you-can-shed-all-you-want-but-if-youre-not-focused-on-the-task-at-hand-while-in-the-practice-room-then-progress-will-be-slow-and-painful-mar-morley-fletcher-shows-us-how-to-avoid-this-trap-in',	'',	'',	'2018-09-19 11:40:59',	'2018-09-19 17:40:59',	'',	0,	'https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local/nxs_qp/you-can-shed-all-you-want-but-if-youre-not-focused-on-the-task-at-hand-while-in-the-practice-room-then-progress-will-be-slow-and-painful-mar-morley-fletcher-shows-us-how-to-avoid-this-trap-in/',	0,	'nxs_qp',	'',	0,	0),
