(7325,	1,	'2019-10-23 13:45:18',	'2019-10-23 18:45:18',	'<img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-7330\" src=\"https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local/wp-content/uploads/ugssp-multiple-screenshots.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"314\" />\r\n\r\nAnyhow who\'s subscribed to the <a href=\"https://bestsaxophonewebsiteever.us2.list-manage.com/subscribe?u=42c62e22f20fe87b4c27dc640&amp;id=e0aed5ed01\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Best. Saxophone. Website. Ever. newsletter</a> or follows the site on social media knows that I\'ve just released a new course by sax legend, David Liebman titled <em><strong>The Ultimate Guide to Saxophone Sound Production. </strong></em>\r\n\r\nIn a nutshell, it\'s the culmination of his entire life\'s work teaching the art of saxophone sound production, and is meant to be <em><strong>the only course on saxophone sound you\'ll ever need</strong></em>. For those of you familiar with his old, out-of-print video  titled, <em>The Complete Guide to Saxophone Sound Production</em>, think of this as the more refined and complete logical extension of that seminal course.\r\n<h2>Here\'s Where I Make You Richer (sort of)</h2>\r\nSo here I am telling anyone who doesn\'t yet know, that the course has been released to the public, and will be on sale at a<strong> 20% discount</strong> until this <strong>Friday, October 25, 2019 at 11:59 PM (PST)</strong>. In other words, it expires on Saturday, October 26.\r\n\r\nSo I want to make sure that nobody reading this before the October 26 deadline misses out on this opportunity to keep a bit of<strong> extra reed money</strong> in their purse or the wallet, or wherever you keep your hard-earned shekels <em>(I\'m Israeli, so I can make that joke).</em>\r\n<h2>The \"Lightning-Round\" of Rapid-Fire Sax Sound Tips</h2>\r\nBut seriously folks...regardless if you\'re interested in clicking on anything else, I wanted to share this video promo which I packed with <strong>as many quick tidbits of saxophone sound wisdom as possible</strong>, so take a look, and if you like what you see, please head over to <a href=\"http://saxophonetone.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>SaxophoneTone.com</strong></a> to learn more, and possibly support the cause of, what I believe to be, <strong>the greatest course on saxophone sound you can buy right now</strong>.\r\n\r\n[raw_html_snippet id=\"ugssp-video-promo-1\"]\r\n<div class=\"writer_promo\"><h4>Once again, that\'s <a href=\"http://saxophonetone.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>SaxophoneTone.com</strong></a> to learn more and get that 20% discount before October 26, 2019!</h4></div>\r\n&nbsp;',	'Sax Sound Tips \"Lightning-Round\" from David Liebman + Reed Money',	'',	'publish',	'open',	'open',	'',	'sax-sound-tips-lightning-round-from-david-liebman',	'',	'',	'2019-11-25 23:15:46',	'2019-11-26 05:15:46',	'',	0,	'https://bestsaxophonewebsiteevercom.local/?p=7325',	0,	'post',	'',	0,	0),
