(67,	4,	'first_name',	'Randy'),
(68,	4,	'last_name',	'Hunter'),
(69,	4,	'nickname',	'randyhunter'),
(70,	4,	'description',	'Randy Hunter is a professional saxophonist, educational author, and private music instructor living in the Atlanta area. He is also the jazz saxophone instructor at Emory University. His series of etude, duet, and combo method books under the title, \"Complete Jazz Styles,\" has received endorsements from a number of well known jazz artists including Joe Lovano, Jerry Bergonzi, Randy Brecker, Bobby Shew, and John Fedchock.'),
