(87,	5,	'nickname',	'Chazz Pratt'),
(88,	5,	'description',	'Charles “Chazz” Pratt III is a lifelong student of the saxophone. He plays as often as he can and has some great friends who continually challenge him to raise the bar on his playing. Chazz can be reached at <a href=\"mailto:chazzonsax@yahoo.com\">chazzonsax@yahoo.com</a> and he will soon include some exciting stuff on his website www.chazzpratt3.com. [Sorry(!), but this web page has disappeared since the original publication]'),
