(103,	6,	'first_name',	'Andrew'),
(104,	6,	'last_name',	'Hadro'),
(105,	6,	'nickname',	'andrewhadro'),
(106,	6,	'description',	'Baritone Saxophonist Andrew Hadro has performed with the Duke Ellington Orchestra, James Moody, the Bjorkestra, Tony Malaby, and performed, recorded several albums, and toured extensively with Chico Hamilton\'s \"Euphoria\" Quintet. He is active in the New York scene and involved in several projects including performances with his own band, and currently tours with Junior Mance’s quintet. He is also currently on faculty at the Litchfield Jazz Camp and teaches private lessons at the Frank Sinatra School of the Arts, through the Lucy Moses School. He is also curator of THE definitive baritone saxophone destination on the web, <a href=\"https://www.JazzBariSax.com\">JazzBariSax.com</a>.'),
