(143,	8,	'nickname',	'daviderato'),
(144,	8,	'description',	'David Erato is a multiple woodwind performer and educator in the Greater Milwaukee area.  He has toured internationally with Blast II: MIX, as well as performed with Dianne Schuur, Bobby Caldwell, and Jon Faddis.  David teaches sax, clarinet, flute, and bassoon at the Waukesha County Conservatory of Music, one of the largest music store/conservatories in the country.  He performs every Thursday with the All-Star SUPERband, and occasionally blogs about music, woodwinds, and anything related at <a href=\"https://www.daviderato.com/blog/\">www.DavidErato.com/Blog</a>.'),
