(164,	9,	'description',	'Danielle, who blogs on behalf of Sears and other prestigious brands, enjoys live music, playing the saxophone, spicy food and crafting with seashells. Read her work at ArtRoomMelody.com [Sorry(!), but this web page has disappeared since the original publication of this article]..'),
