(183,	10,	'first_name',	'Bill'),
(184,	10,	'last_name',	'Harrison'),
(185,	10,	'nickname',	'billharrison'),
(186,	10,	'description',	'Bill Harrison is a bassist who lives in Chicago. His jazz credits include work with Clark Terry, James Moody, Patricia Barber, Dizzy Gillespie, Max Roach, Kenny Burrell, Frank Wess, Bunky Green, Woody Herman Band and Joe Daley. Bill created and runs <a href=\"http://www.playjazznow.com/\">PlayJazzNow</a>, a website offering innovative, downloadable play-along tracks for instrumentalists and singers of all levels. He blogs about musical life at <a href=\"http://jazzunderneath.blogspot.com/\">Jazz Underneath</a> and contributes to <a href=\"https://bassmusicianmagazine.com/author/billharrison\">Bass Musician Magazine</a>. Subscribe to Bill’s monthly newsletter <a href=\"http://www.playjazznow.com/\">The Lead Sheet</a> featuring Jazz News You Can Use.'),
