(226,	12,	'description',	'Multi-instrumentalist Mark Catoe works as a freelance musician in Charlotte, NC. Notable performances include engagements with The Charlotte Symphony, The Temptations, and The Four Tops among others. In addition to performing throughout the southeast, Mark maintains a private teaching studio.'),
