(263,	14,	'first_name',	'Todd S.'),
(264,	14,	'last_name',	'Feldman'),
(265,	14,	'nickname',	'toddsfeldman'),
(266,	14,	'description',	'Todd currently serves as the Senior Director of Marketing Communications for instrument manufacturer, RS Berkeley. In his role, Todd oversees the design and distribution of marketing and public relations materials, manages the content and functionality of company websites and works with the company’s sales, marketing and product development teams to increase institutional and consumer awareness of RS Berkeley brands. Todd works closely with a number of educational organizations and programs, including:  Jazz House Kids, Horns To Havana and Litchfield Jazz Festival/Camp in Connecticut. Among his favored job responsibilities includes, managing endorser relations, which allows him to work alongside some of the top names in contemporary and jazz music today, including recording artists: Chris Potter, Joe Lovano, Eddie Daniels, Paquito D’Rivera, Tim Ries, Andy Snitzer, Esperanza Spalding and Regina Carter to name a few.'),
