(459,	23,	'nickname',	'wayneland'),
(460,	23,	'description',	'Wayne Land is a virtuoso saxophonist with over 45 years of teaching and playing experience and two degrees in music education. He is a regular contributor to The ZOEN Blog.&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.musicplay.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; Contact Wayne</a> for tips, expert advice and instruction. You can find more expert sax instructors on The ZOEN.'),
