(554,	28,	'description',	'Eugene Cantera is a partner and faculty member of The Dallas School of Music. He is also a contributor to dlpsaxophone.com, 1Series Saxophone and the dlp catalogue of online music education resources. DSM provides a variety of products and services for individuals as well as organizations helping people to discover, learn, and play music. Visit dlp music program for more information: <a href=\"https://www.dsminfo.com/\">https://www.dsminfo.com/</a>'),
