(610,	31,	'first_name',	'Johnny'),
(611,	31,	'last_name',	'Ferreira'),
(612,	31,	'description',	'Touring with some of history’s most profound rock names, including The Rolling Stones, Steve Winwood, Robert Plant, ZZ Top, Keith Richards, Little Feat, and Stevie Ray Vaughn. Touring and recording continues and his 4th solo CD \"Rock &amp; Roll Saxophonist\". Many of Ferreira’s songs have weaved themselves into Movies and television. His unmistakable sax sound is featured on many other CDs besides his own, many of which have reached gold and platinum status.'),
