(649,	33,	'last_name',	'Edwards'),
(650,	33,	'description',	'Scott Edwards is the founder of <a href=\"https://www.eartraininghq.com/\">EarTrainingHQ.com</a>. He has helped thousands of musicians to train their ears quickly and easily with his approach to ear training, that focuses on breaking the process of ear training down into easy to follow steps and providing effective, targeted exercises for each step along the way.'),
