(754,	37,	'description',	'Simon is a music production enthusiast and runs his own tips and reviews blog. Mixing by day, learning by night he has been in the production industry for over 10 years. Like every budding music producer, Simon\'s goal is to one day make it big, just like all of you. Check him out over at MusicProTools.com [sorry, url is no longer active].'),
