(805,	39,	'description',	'Nick Bottini is a peak performance coach, music educator and saxophonist based in London, UK. He works with musicians to unlock their full potential by helping them explore their mental game, much the same way that sports coaches do for athletes. He is available for face-to-face and Skype coaching and can be contacted at <a href=\"mailto:nicholas_bottini@hotmail.co.uk\">nicholas_bottini@hotmail.co.uk</a>.'),
