(987,	45,	'description',	'Glen Parry has been a musician for over 15 years. He’s done everything the hard way so you don’t have to. You can find more musical advice and audio gear buying guides, such as this <a href=\"https://www.audiomastered.com/blue-yeti-vs-at2020/\">comparison of condenser microphones</a>, over at <a href=\"https://www.audiomastered.com\">https://www.audiomastered.com</a>.'),
