(1094,	47,	'last_name',	'Rhythm'),
(1095,	47,	'description',	'DN Rhythm is a jazz educator, tutor, musician, saxophonist, drummer, bassist, piano and flute player, graphic designer, author and composer from New York City. He has given many musicians, both young and old places to learn, practice and perform, and his ongoing contributions are greatly appreciated by those who know him in the music community on both the performance as well as business side.'),
