(1293,	51,	'nickname',	'playinthezone'),
(1294,	51,	'first_name',	'Mark'),
(1295,	51,	'last_name',	'Morley-Fletcher'),
(1296,	51,	'description',	'I’m a jazz guitarist and educator who specializes in training the mental skills that produce outstanding, enjoyable performances. When I’m not on the tennis court honing my ability to raise my game under pressure, or out exploring the beautiful Scottish countryside, I help musicians tame performance anxiety and play to their full potential when it counts. I believe that your hard work in the practice room deserves to lead to consistently great performances – visit <a href=\"https://playinthezone.com\">https://playinthezone.com</a> to discover all the resources that I’ve put together to help you.'),
