(1360,	53,	'description',	'Matthew Smith is a UK based saxophonist &amp; educator. He has been playing gigs since his early teens throughout the UK and in Europe. He also has a thriving private teaching practice, both in person and through FaceTime &amp; Skype and has pupils worldwide through SAXOPHONE Studies.com (http://saxophonestudies.com)'),
