(1646,	61,	'description',	'Harry Cherrin is an American saxophonist, improviser and composer currently living in the Netherlands. Since finishing his studies with renowned saxophonist Arno Bornkamp in 2009, Harry has performed with a variety of Classical, Experimental, Jazz, and Pop groups throughout Europe, as well as regularly performing solo Bach saxophone recitals.'),
